Error [E0766]: This call to `verify_jwt` is missing `issuer`
  --> auth_token_keeps_credential_leak_protection.jet:7:15
    |
  7 |     _ := auth.verify_jwt(token, key: key, audience: "gateway")
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `issuer` has no default, so every call has to supply it
 Fix: Add `issuer: …` to the call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0766

